  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ms Singh Medical Agency vs State Of U.P.And 2 Others on 8 November, 2023 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2023:Ahc:214522 Court No. - 93 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 37024 of 2023 Applicant :- Ms Singh Medical Agency Opposite Party :- State Of U.P.And 2 Others",
    "facts": "2. The present application has been filed to quash the entire criminal proceedings arising out of Criminal Complaint Case No.8690 of 2023 (State Vs. Saurabh Chaurasiya and others), u/s 26/59 and 52 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, Police Station-Robertsganj, District-Sonbhadra, pending in the court of Chief Judicial Magistrate, Sonbhadra and also quash the summoning order dated 13.06.2023 passed by the In-charge Chief Judicial Magistrate, Sonbhadra and also quash the bailable warrants dated 01.07.2023 and 28.08.2023 against the applicant issued by the Chief Judicial Magistrate, Sonbhadra. 3.",
    "arguments": "At the very outset, learned counsel for the applicant submits that the applicant does not want to press the prayer for quashing the impugned proceeding and want to surrender before the court Ms Singh Medical Agency vs State Of U.P.And 2 Others on 8 November, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/63006154/ 1 below and apply for bail.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "At the very outset, learned counsel for the applicant submits that the applicant does not want to press the prayer for quashing the impugned proceeding and want to surrender before the court Ms Singh Medical Agency vs State Of U.P.And 2 Others on 8 November, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/63006154/ 1 below and apply for bail.",
